Open data exception
-------------------
The open price datasets are published under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 licence (CC BY 4.0) and are free to reuse with credit to
GolfPrice AI and a link to golfpriceai.com:

  - prices/data/golf-prices-uk.csv
  - prices/data/golf-price-history-uk.csv
  - data/demand/index.json (UK Golf Demand Index)

This exception covers those data files only, not the code or design that
produces or displays them.

